02(g)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(h) Council on Environmental Quality.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-102(h)","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-102(h)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(i) Civil Service Commission, and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-102(i)","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-102(i)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(j) Council on Wage and Price Stability","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-102(j)","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-102(j)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-103. The Director of the Office of Management and Budget will serve as Chairman of the Council.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-103","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-103","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-201. The Council will work with Executive agencies to assure that activities designed to improve productivity in the private and public sectors are carried out in a manner that realizes maximum benefit from the resources invested. As part of this responsibility the Council will identify opportunities for cooperative or innovative projects to be undertaken by the agencies, as well as overlapping or duplicative programs which should be eliminated.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-201","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-201","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-202. The Council will identify issues pertaining to private and public sector productivity and productivity improvement, and will make assignments to Council members or other Executive agencies for studying and resolving the issues.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-202","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-202","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-203. The Council will identify major policy issues with productivity implications for consideration by the President, including the need for legislative initiatives.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-203","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-203","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-204. The Council will serve as the focal point within the Executive Branch for liaison with elements of the private sector concerned with improving productivity, and will seek the advice and assistance of business, labor, and academic leaders, as well as representatives from State and local governments and others concerned with productivity.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-204","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-204","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-205. The Council will serve as the focal point within the Executive Branch for liaison with organizations of foreign governments involved in efforts to improve productivity.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-205","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-205","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-301. Executive agencies shall cooperate with and assist the Council in performing its functions.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-301","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-301","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-302. The Chairman shall be responsible for providing the Council with such administrative services and support as may be necessary or appropriate.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-302","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-302","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-303. The Chairman may establish working groups or subcommittees of the Council. The Chairman may invite representatives of nonmember agencies to participate from time to time in the functions of the Council.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-303","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-303","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-304. The Chairman shall report to the President on the performance of the Council's functions.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 243479; common-crawl capture 2024-05-29T08:56:24Z; Sec. 1-304","sha256":"9ed17a9cda50c3534b79ce8feff2e6933b13fbd59eeac4dd6a4c1da1714ce34b","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12089-national-productivity-council"},"scope_id":"EO:12089#sec1-304","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"43 FR 49773, PDF pages 19-20","sha256":"4d29044157a4a65a0e09c8298ee54edb7a63dcec5fe29633136aeea8f503b5d8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1978-10-25/pdf/FR-1978-10-25.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 22 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:12089"}
